{#
    "Organized by <organization>" in the byline of the series, edition and event pages (owner: workstream A,
    docs/features/organizations/README.md "Organized by"): the organization's name links its page. Shown while the
    organization is publicly visible - to everyone - or, when it is not (a draft, waiting for approval, rejected), to its
    team only, marked "Not public". The voter is asked only for a non-public organization, so public pages pay no
    statement. The name is escaped before it goes into the sentence (as event_parts/_event_time.html.twig assembles its
    text).

    Variables: organization (null|OrganizationRef)
#}
{%- if organization is not null and (organization.isPublic or is_granted('ORGANIZATION_EDIT', organization.id)) -%}
    <span class="ev-detail-by ev-organized-by" data-organized-by="{{ organization.id }}">
        {{- 'organization.byline.organized_by'|trans({
            '%name%': '<a href="' ~ path('organization_detail', {slug: organization.slug})|e ~ '">' ~ organization.name|e ~ '</a>',
        })|raw -}}
        {%- if not organization.isPublic %} <span class="ev-tag ev-tag-not-public">{{ 'organization_page.byline.not_public'|trans }}</span>{% endif -%}
    </span>
{%- endif -%}
